{"product_id":"viking-ships-at-sunrise","title":"Viking Ships at Sunrise","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe #1 bestselling chapter book series of all time celebrates 25 years with new covers and a new, easy-to-use numbering system! \"Beware of Vikings!\" warns Morgan. Then Jack and Annie are whisked back to ancient Ireland. They land on a cliff on a misty island. How will they find the story they are looking for? It will take a Viking invasion, the help of a jolly monk, and a lot of courage for Jack and Annie to succeed in Viking Ships at Sunrise. Did you know that there’s a Magic Tree House book for every kid? Magic Tree House: Adventures with Jack and Annie, perfect for readers who are just beginning chapter books Merlin Missions: More challenging adventures for the experienced reader Super Edition: A longer and more dangerous adventure Fact Trackers: Nonfiction companions to your favorite Magic Tree House adventures\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mary Pope Osborne\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780679890614\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898401153177,"sku":"17RE-2-9780679890614","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691827d0f19f4_Viking_Ships_at_Sunrise.jpg?v=1763202701","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/viking-ships-at-sunrise","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}